    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXIT - N.F</strong>. is a <strong>FREE</strong> <strong>VR</strong> extraction game. Your <strong>objective</strong> is to <strong>escape</strong> from a strange place with a <strong>worrying atmosphere.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape from it, you will have to find <strong>different objects</strong> to repel the creatures and <strong>access different places.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Use tools</strong> to advance and <strong>grow back\u00a0creatures</strong>. But be careful to <strong>use wisely</strong> so you don\u2019t run out of durability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unscripted universe</strong>, depending on the player\u2019s actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Appearance of random objects</strong> to always offer different <strong>games</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Creatures reactive</strong> to the <strong>player\u2019s actions...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware,</strong> the more time you <strong>spend</strong> in these places, the more they will become strange and play with your <strong>mind</strong>...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXIT - N.F</strong>. is a <strong>FREE</strong> <strong>VR</strong> extraction game. Your <strong>objective</strong> is to <strong>escape</strong> from a strange place with a <strong>worrying atmosphere.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape from it, you will have to find <strong>different objects</strong> to repel the creatures and <strong>access different places.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Use tools</strong> to advance and <strong>grow back\u00a0creatures</strong>. But be careful to <strong>use wisely</strong> so you don\u2019t run out of durability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unscripted universe</strong>, depending on the player\u2019s actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Appearance of random objects</strong> to always offer different <strong>games</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Creatures reactive</strong> to the <strong>player\u2019s actions...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware,</strong> the more time you <strong>spend</strong> in these places, the more they will become strange and play with your <strong>mind</strong>...</p>",
